# Generated outputs — never format these.
#
# Rule 2.19 is "edit the generator, never the output". Prettier breaks that rule
# by definition: it rewrites the file on disk, the generator then re-emits its
# own formatting on the next run, and the two disagree permanently. The result
# is `public/service-worker.js` showing as modified after every `npm run dev`
# (trap 20) — churn nobody authored and nobody should commit.
#
# All three are written by scripts/generate-pwa-assets.js.
public/manifest.json
public/service-worker.js
src/lib/pwa-version.ts

# Generated from docs/seo/SEO_TASKS.json by scripts/seo-report.mjs — same
# reasoning as above: edit the source JSON, regenerate, never reformat the output.
docs/seo/SEO_TASK_LOG.md

# Build artefacts and test reports. Not source, not reviewed, frequently huge.
.next/
out/
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Lockfiles are owned by the package manager's own formatting.
package-lock.json
